    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quā^drātūra</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		quadro. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A making square</i>, <i>squaring</i>,
				<i>quadrature</i> (postclass.): circuli
			quadratura, <i>the squaring</i> or <i>quadrature of the circle</i>, <i><span class="en">App.
				Dogm. Plat. 3, p. 37, 11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a square</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitreae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vop. Firm. 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
